0.\n$$\n\nComputing the dot product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & ={a}_{x}\\cdot {b}_{x}+{a}_{y}\\cdot {b}_{y}+{a}_{z}\\cdot {b}_{z} \\\\  & =1\\cdot 1+3\\cdot (-2)+2\\cdot x \\\\  & =2x-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ 2x-5 & =0 \\\\ 2x & =5 \\\\ x & =\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186290949 #edb/ref 1080 "0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186290949 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186290949 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4a7dc270-f137-54cf-9419-46838c6c877f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291031 #edb/ref 1080 "0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291031 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291031 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5d5388db-d9ca-5e4a-b927-ca4eff155a48" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291094 #edb/ref 1080 "-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291094 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291094 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6b2f8463-684a-51b6-b307-1b42f3e3157f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291332 #edb/ref 1080 "0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291332 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291332 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a0d8b789-cf9a-5585-bf99-8b3562a45fd7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291437 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291437 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291437 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ba44b3f3-6bd6-597b-89fb-265b4431caa0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291583 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291583 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291583 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e3e8095f-3d51-5f54-8b4e-b27089d59b52" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291882 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186291437 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186291882 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [175921